1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
一个包子，蒸裂了才算成功
A bun that must crack to pass

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,400
顶上裂成三瓣："开口笑"
Split in three — "the smiling mouth"

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,600
不裂？广东师傅直接不认
No crack? The master won't sign off

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,800
裂口里，露出蜜汁叉烧
The crack reveals honey-glazed pork

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,000
面要发得松，一蒸就爆
Dough so light it bursts as it steams

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,200
高身雀笼型，大肚收笃
Tall as a birdcage, tucked at the base

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,400
咬一口，咸甜叉烧流出来
Bite in — sweet-savory pork spills out

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,600
它是广州认证的非遗
A Guangzhou-listed heritage craft

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,800
"饮啖茶，食个包"——就它
"Sip some tea, eat a bun" — this one

10
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,000
早茶"四大天王"第三位
The third of dim sum's Four Kings

11
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,200
叉烧包，你先吃顶还是先吃馅？
The cracked top, or the filling first?

12
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,600
下集：你以为它是西点
Next: the one you'll swear is Western
